{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2021-04-22 15:00:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES SEEKS TO ADVANCE SUSTAINABLE AVIATION FUEL THROUGH TWO NEW ENERGY PARTNERSHIPS', 'text': 'DALLAS, APRIL 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO . (NYSE: LUV) TODAY ANNOUNCED MEMORANDA OF UNDERSTANDING WITH TWO LEADING ENERGY COMPANIES, MARATHON PETROLEUM CORPORATION (NYSE: MPC), AND PHILLIPS 66 (NYSE: PSX), INTENDED TO FACILITATE THE DEVELOPMENT AND PRODUCTION OF COMMERCIALIZED SUSTAINABLE AVIATION FUEL (SAF).'}